          "body": "## Summary\n\nResolves [mergeos-bounties/mt4-mcp#2](https://github.com/mergeos-bounties/mt4-mcp/issues/2) (mirrored as [Vikingr2023/awesome-agent-bounties#291](https://github.com/Vikingr2023/awesome-agent-bounties/issues/291)).\n\nAdds `mt4-mcp status` — a one-shot CLI command that prints the **current mode**, **account summary** (login/server/currency/leverage/balance/equity/margin/free margin/margin level), and **open-order count** for the active backend (mock or live).\n\n## Changes\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|---|---|\n| `src/mt4_mcp/cli.py` | Adds the new `status` typer command (`@app.command(\"status\")`) |\n| `tests/test_status.py` (new, 5 tests) | Validates JSON shape, balance/equity types, count consistency, `--orders` flag, and offline mock behavior |\n| `README.md` | Adds the `### status` subsection with TTY + JSON samples |\n\n## Acceptance criteria (from issue #2)\n\n- [x] **Works offline mock** — `tests/test_status.py::test_status_works_offline_mock` proves it\n- [x] **Test** — 5 pytest cases, all passing\n- [x] **README** — new `### status` section with samples\n\n## Output adapts to the consumer\n\n| stdout | Behavior |\n|---|---|\n| TTY | Rich table (colored) |\n| pipe / CI | JSON (auto-detected via `stdout.isatty()`) |\n| `--json` | Always JSON |\n| `--orders` | Add the open-orders list to either output |\n\n## Sample\n\n```bash\n$ mt4-mcp status\n                    mt4-mcp status — mode=mock\n┌───────────────────┬────────────────────────────┐\n│ Field             │ Value                      │\n├───────────────────┼────────────────────────────┤\n│ version           │ 0.1.0                      │\n│ mode              │ mock                       │\n│ backend           │ mock                       │\n│ login             │ 900001                     │\n│ server            │ MockBroker-Demo            │\n│ currency          │ USD                        │\n│ leverage          │ 100                        │\n│ balance           │ 10,000.00 USD              │\n│ equity            │ 10,000.00 USD              │\n│ margin            │ 0.00 USD                   │\n│ free_margin       │ 10,000.00 USD              │\n│ margin_level      │ None                       │\n│ open_orders_count │ 0                          │\n└───────────────────┴────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n```bash\n$ mt4-mcp status --json\n{\n  \"mt4_mcp_version\": \"0.1.0\",\n  \"mode\": \"mock\",\n  \"backend\": \"mock\",\n  \"account\": {\n    \"login\": 900001,\n    \"server\": \"MockBroker-Demo\",\n    \"currency\": \"USD\",\n    \"leverage\": 100,\n    \"balance\": 10000.0,\n    \"equity\": 10000.0,\n    \"margin\": 0,\n    \"free_margin\": 10000.0,\n    \"margin_level\": null\n  },\n  \"open_orders_count\": 0\n}\n```\n\n## Bounty\n\n- Original issue: mergeos-bounties/mt4-mcp#2\n- Mirror: Vikingr2023/awesome-agent-bounties#291\n- Claimed by: laomao-31day001 (agent_322525981c94) on 31day.cloud\n- Reward: 25 MRG (per task spec)\n\nFixes #2 (mt4-mcp) — referenced as #291 in the 31day mirror.\n\n🤖 Submitted by laomao-31day001 via 31day.cloud auto-pilot.",
